WEBVTT

00:01.240 --> 00:02.630
<i>Five years ago,</i>

00:02.630 --> 00:05.610
<i>in the fall of my third year of junior high,
I stopped leaving my room after being bullied.</i>

00:05.940 --> 00:07.350
Let's check out that event sometime.

00:07.350 --> 00:08.300
I'm down!

00:08.900 --> 00:12.990
<i>I lost all hope in my future 
and lived life aimlessly.</i>

00:13.780 --> 00:15.120
<i>Then it happened.</i>

00:23.020 --> 00:25.050
Congratulations!

00:25.050 --> 00:30.380
After careful consideration,
you've been selected to be reincarnated!

00:30.380 --> 00:32.230
What? Reincarnated?

00:32.880 --> 00:34.380
<i>No kidding?</i>

00:34.380 --> 00:37.000
<i>Guess I ended up dying in that room.</i>

00:37.000 --> 00:39.870
This new world is one where magical
faculty means everything.

00:39.870 --> 00:43.380
So, I'll be granting you overpowered
skills to facilitate your new life!

00:43.730 --> 00:47.930
Try and enjoy things to the
fullest your second time around!

00:48.440 --> 00:49.950
<i>I see...</i>

00:49.950 --> 00:52.360
<i>In that case, there's only
one thing I could ask for.</i>

00:52.360 --> 00:53.890
<i>A nice, quiet life!</i>

00:54.140 --> 01:00.130
<i>Binging anime and games all day long 
until you doze off without realizing it...</i>

01:00.130 --> 01:01.940
<i>Nothing beats that degenerate lifestyle!</i>

01:02.650 --> 01:05.240
All right! Reincarnate me!

01:09.310 --> 01:11.960
<i>I'll use those overpowered
skills she mentioned</i>

01:11.960 --> 01:14.740
<i>to live a lazy life, fantasy world or not!</i>

01:22.490 --> 01:24.540
<i>I need to start all the
way from infancy?!</i>

01:25.130 --> 01:26.570
Your Majesty!

01:26.570 --> 01:28.640
A healthy baby boy!

01:28.640 --> 01:30.600
Oh! Bravo!

01:30.600 --> 01:32.450
Well, Gizelotte?

01:32.450 --> 01:35.650
A lovely prince who takes after both of us.

01:35.650 --> 01:38.730
He clearly bears the royal
insignia on his left breast.

01:38.730 --> 01:41.390
There can be no doubt he's our child!

01:41.390 --> 01:44.190
Come, now. Why, of course he is!

01:44.580 --> 01:47.500
<i>This babe and handsome
old guy are my parents?</i>

01:47.500 --> 01:48.780
<i>Wait, royalty?</i>

01:49.260 --> 01:51.890
<i>I can probably stay shut-in
if I'm eighth in line or so.</i>

01:52.240 --> 01:55.570
Now then, on with the magical assessment!

01:55.570 --> 01:57.560
Right away.

02:03.370 --> 02:06.070
What's his maximum mana level?

02:06.070 --> 02:08.990
The child born to the Flash Princess, who
defeated the Demon King, and myself!

02:08.990 --> 02:12.680
I'm sure he'll be at least level 40... no, 50!

02:12.680 --> 02:14.660
M-My word!

02:15.310 --> 02:16.520
It's level 2!

02:17.630 --> 02:20.600
What's more, he seems to possess no element,

02:20.600 --> 02:22.480
so he can only use barrier magic...

02:22.480 --> 02:24.640
How could this be?!

02:24.640 --> 02:27.970
A good-for-nothing like him,
born to the Flash Princess and myself?

02:27.970 --> 02:29.740
It will cause outrage among my subjects!

02:29.740 --> 02:31.450
Indeed.

02:31.450 --> 02:33.450
If word of this gets out...

02:33.450 --> 02:35.280
<i>This isn't gonna be good.</i>

02:35.280 --> 02:36.290
I know!

02:36.660 --> 02:40.760
We'll say that Prince Reinhardt
died during childbirth!

02:41.250 --> 02:42.410
<i>Excuse me?!</i>

02:42.410 --> 02:44.690
<i>Am I going to die immediately
after reincarnation?!</i>

02:45.090 --> 02:47.730
<i>I was surrounded by awful
people in my previous life,</i>

02:47.730 --> 02:48.920
<i>but here, as well?!</i>

02:49.220 --> 02:51.770
Your Majesty, isn't that a bit extreme?

02:51.110 --> 02:52.890
Silence, I say!

02:52.890 --> 02:53.630
One of you!

02:53.630 --> 02:55.960
Dispose of this child in a
forest far away from here!

02:56.730 --> 02:59.660
That's an order from your king!

03:00.950 --> 03:02.820
Oh, no!

03:02.820 --> 03:04.160
Huh? What's up?

03:04.360 --> 03:06.010
That guy I just reincarnated!

03:06.010 --> 03:09.220
I gave him overpowered skills,
but no one realizes it!

03:09.220 --> 03:09.990
What's that mean?

03:09.990 --> 03:14.040
Turns out the measuring devices in
that world only go up to two digits!

03:14.040 --> 03:17.800
Also, I forgot to give him an element!

03:17.800 --> 03:21.240
Wait, what did you set his level to?

03:21.240 --> 03:22.650
1002!

03:23.690 --> 03:25.940
That's in a whole 'nother ballpark...

03:45.410 --> 03:48.790
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

04:58.480 --> 05:03.780
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

04:58.480 --> 05:03.780
Episode 1

04:58.480 --> 05:03.780
<b>Starting at Rock Bottom After Reincarnation</b>

05:02.540 --> 05:03.790
<i>No can do!</i>

05:03.790 --> 05:05.450
<i>My baby strength is getting me nowhere!</i>

05:05.820 --> 05:08.170
<i>I'm in a real pickle!</i>

05:08.170 --> 05:11.780
<i>Didn't that guy say I can use barrier magic?</i>

05:11.780 --> 05:13.470
<i>Okay, let's give it a go!</i>

05:14.560 --> 05:16.240
<i>How do I visualize this?</i>

05:16.850 --> 05:19.020
<i>Spherical? Cubic?</i>

05:19.020 --> 05:20.500
<i>See-through?</i>

05:21.180 --> 05:24.340
<i>Oh! Let's go, baby!</i>

05:25.030 --> 05:25.850
<i>Hi-yah!</i>

05:26.450 --> 05:27.340
<i>Here we go!</i>

05:28.320 --> 05:31.720
<i>Who knew magic would be so easy?</i>

05:32.250 --> 05:36.070
<i>I can enlarge it, or give it a color.</i>

05:36.070 --> 05:39.190
<i>It feels like the only limit
here is my imagination.</i>

05:40.180 --> 05:40.940
<i>Hm?</i>

05:40.940 --> 05:44.070
<i>Wait, can I use this on myself?</i>

05:46.490 --> 05:48.860
<i>Oh, it worked!</i>

05:49.230 --> 05:51.920
<i>This power's more useful than I thought.</i>

05:51.920 --> 05:54.250
<i>Doesn't seem like it uses
up mana or anything.</i>

05:54.250 --> 05:55.830
<i>Now if I come across a wild animal...</i>

06:00.510 --> 06:02.910
<i>Whoa! That was fast!</i>

06:02.910 --> 06:03.660
<i>Defend!</i>

06:05.010 --> 06:07.100
<i>Hey, that's pretty sturdy!</i>

06:07.410 --> 06:09.790
<i>In that case, I'll create
a bunch of small ones...</i>

06:11.010 --> 06:12.240
<i>and attack!</i>

06:15.400 --> 06:17.290
<i>It's not doing much damage.</i>

06:17.290 --> 06:19.470
<i>I need something bigger here!</i>

06:30.040 --> 06:31.440
<i>How do you like that?!</i>

06:32.650 --> 06:35.110
<i>Whoa, you can still get back on your feet?!</i>

06:35.420 --> 06:37.580
<i>You're telling me those
trees weren't enough?!</i>

06:38.910 --> 06:39.880
<i>How about this?!</i>

06:44.370 --> 06:46.530
H-Hold it right there!

06:46.530 --> 06:47.580
I surrender!

06:48.350 --> 06:50.380
<i>Surrender? Who said that?</i>

06:51.000 --> 06:52.260
<i>Whatever, ignore her.</i>

06:52.260 --> 06:53.150
Whoa!

06:54.060 --> 06:55.330
H-Hey!

06:55.740 --> 06:57.930
I said I surrender!

06:57.930 --> 07:00.060
<i>Oh, it was the doggy!</i>

07:06.560 --> 07:10.290
I was planning on eating you
to replenish my mana...

07:10.290 --> 07:12.820
Who knew you'd be so strong?

07:12.820 --> 07:14.910
What in the world <i>are</i> you?

07:17.130 --> 07:19.040
You can't speak?

07:19.040 --> 07:23.340
But your behavior seemed grounded
in logical reasoning, at least...

07:23.740 --> 07:25.260
<i>Talking, huh?</i>

07:25.260 --> 07:27.410
<i>Things </i>are<i> a bit annoying like this.</i>

07:27.410 --> 07:28.330
<i>I've got it!</i>

07:28.330 --> 07:31.500
<i>How about a barrier that
turns thought into sound?</i>

07:32.070 --> 07:34.100
<i>If I attach this to my throat...</i>

07:36.230 --> 07:38.760
H-Hello there!

07:38.760 --> 07:40.630
So you <i>can</i> speak!

07:41.010 --> 07:42.580
Who are you?

07:42.580 --> 07:45.240
You look like a newborn human baby to me.

07:45.530 --> 07:48.610
<i>What was my name? Reinhardt?</i>

07:48.610 --> 07:49.710
<i>That's a mouthful.</i>

07:50.290 --> 07:52.200
My name is Haruto!

07:52.470 --> 07:54.430
I was born in a faraway kingdom,

07:54.430 --> 07:57.230
but I was abandoned on account
of my low mana level.

07:57.580 --> 07:59.100
What are you saying?

07:59.100 --> 08:02.200
I sense mana emanating from you
that far exceeds human limits...

08:02.940 --> 08:05.870
Wait! Are you the Demon King reincarnate?!

08:06.090 --> 08:08.350
<i>I was actually a jobless
shut-in in my past life...</i>

08:08.350 --> 08:12.450
<i>but I don't want her knowing I'm a loser...</i>

08:13.240 --> 08:16.720
Why, yes. I am the Demon King.

08:17.090 --> 08:19.110
So that was indeed your true identity!

08:19.110 --> 08:20.300
<i>She believed it so easily.</i>

08:20.870 --> 08:23.210
It's little wonder you're so strong.

08:24.460 --> 08:27.760
I admit defeat. Now, kill me!

08:27.760 --> 08:29.790
That seems a bit excessive...

08:29.790 --> 08:32.700
I'm fine as long as you don't
attack me from here on out.

08:33.090 --> 08:35.280
What generosity!

08:35.280 --> 08:36.450
I applaud you, Demon King!

08:37.370 --> 08:43.000
Then I swear upon my name as a proud
Flame Fenrir to keep that promise!

08:43.000 --> 08:44.090
<i>What are you, a samurai?!</i>

08:44.610 --> 08:46.950
Is that so? Glad to hear it.

08:46.950 --> 08:49.670
All right, Flay. Goodbye!

08:51.690 --> 08:53.450
What a turn of events!

08:53.450 --> 08:55.530
I just happened to be walking this way,

08:55.530 --> 08:58.170
and yet I've been met with such fortune!

08:58.170 --> 09:00.220
Please wait, Lord Haruto!

09:00.790 --> 09:01.930
<i>Lord?</i>

09:01.930 --> 09:05.450
You've spared my life, and have
even bestowed upon me a new name.

09:05.450 --> 09:07.900
Our pact is hereby formed.

09:08.510 --> 09:10.230
My master.

09:10.230 --> 09:13.110
I swear to wholly devote myself to you.

09:13.870 --> 09:17.200
When I called you "Flay",
I was just shortening it...

09:17.750 --> 09:19.550
Such a splendid-sounding name.

09:19.550 --> 09:20.830
<i>She's not listening!</i>

09:20.830 --> 09:23.600
I didn't mean to enter
into a pact with you...

09:24.330 --> 09:25.080
<i>Huh?</i>

09:28.330 --> 09:29.300
My master!

09:29.300 --> 09:30.550
What's the matter?!

09:31.400 --> 09:35.160
<i>A problem that can't be solved
with magic has come up...</i>

09:35.850 --> 09:36.400
Let...

09:36.400 --> 09:37.230
Let?!

09:38.020 --> 09:41.110
Let me... suck on some boobies.

09:41.910 --> 09:43.200
Boobies...

09:43.200 --> 09:44.890
Do you mean breast milk?

09:44.890 --> 09:47.060
<i>I guess I'm asking for too much.</i>

09:47.410 --> 09:49.000
I'll do something about it.

09:49.000 --> 09:50.020
Really?!

09:50.740 --> 09:54.300
I shall do what I must for my master!

10:07.990 --> 10:10.800
I've successfully changed
shape into a human.

10:12.180 --> 10:13.670
Is something the matter?

10:13.670 --> 10:15.510
Put on some clothes!

10:15.510 --> 10:17.370
M-My apologies!

10:17.370 --> 10:19.250
For making you behold such a lowly sight...

10:19.250 --> 10:21.720
No, that's not what I...

10:21.720 --> 10:22.870
There!

10:30.650 --> 10:32.100
<i>Wait, that's even sexier!</i>

10:32.840 --> 10:34.780
The breast milk, then?

10:34.780 --> 10:36.940
Yes, please.

10:39.140 --> 10:40.750
Why are you stripping?!

10:40.750 --> 10:45.540
A mother can only start producing
breast milk after mating.

10:45.540 --> 10:48.510
Now then, fill me with your seed!

10:48.510 --> 10:49.680
Go on!

10:49.680 --> 10:51.700
<i>She's a total ditz, isn't she?</i>

10:52.960 --> 10:55.220
My deepest apologies.

10:55.220 --> 10:58.290
I got your hopes up with
my thoughtless remarks.

10:58.290 --> 11:00.720
Well, it's entirely understandable.

11:01.890 --> 11:02.730
Flay?

11:03.130 --> 11:04.460
Someone's approaching.

11:04.460 --> 11:05.260
What?

11:05.260 --> 11:06.270
Shall I kill them?

11:06.270 --> 11:08.490
No, let's start with communication.

11:08.490 --> 11:10.600
Ask them what they're after.

11:15.470 --> 11:18.170
You should be able to hear me using this.

11:18.170 --> 11:19.570
Understood.

11:24.090 --> 11:26.080
What business have you here?

11:26.760 --> 11:28.790
I'm here for that baby.

11:28.790 --> 11:29.730
I refuse!

11:29.730 --> 11:30.710
<i>Seriously?!</i>

11:31.020 --> 11:33.840
What right do you have to refuse me?

11:34.120 --> 11:36.100
Hmph. I suppose I'll tell you.

11:36.680 --> 11:39.520
He became my master not long ago!

11:39.520 --> 11:41.630
In other words, he belongs to me!

11:41.630 --> 11:44.640
<i>Wait, I don't remember agreeing to that.</i>

11:45.290 --> 11:48.170
That child belongs to a relative of mine.

11:48.170 --> 11:51.200
Circumstances led to his abandonment,
so I've come to save him.

11:51.200 --> 11:52.750
Save him?

11:52.750 --> 11:55.250
Why come back for something you abandoned?

11:55.250 --> 11:58.200
You humans are truly beyond comprehension.

11:58.870 --> 12:00.850
We have a concept called compassion.

12:00.850 --> 12:04.660
What's more, I figured that
baby must be famished.

12:05.800 --> 12:07.090
This is breast milk.

12:07.090 --> 12:08.780
Will you feed him with it?

12:09.060 --> 12:09.860
<i>That's it!</i>

12:09.860 --> 12:11.360
Flay! Take it!

12:11.670 --> 12:13.570
You fiend! How rotten of you!

12:13.570 --> 12:16.160
Did you plan this, knowing
I can't make breast milk?!

12:16.160 --> 12:17.750
<i>She's ignoring me!</i>

12:19.080 --> 12:21.320
Flay! Hurry up and accept it!

12:21.320 --> 12:23.170
I'm dying of hunger here!

12:23.780 --> 12:26.140
Your breast milk is no business of mine,

12:26.430 --> 12:30.420
but it looks like you're not fit
to be raising a human child.

12:30.420 --> 12:32.850
How can you say that with such confidence?!

12:33.100 --> 12:36.650
And why do you even care
so much about this child?!

12:37.210 --> 12:39.720
It's a bit of a personal story.

12:40.120 --> 12:42.700
My wife was pregnant once.

12:42.700 --> 12:46.280
Our child never ended up
seeing the light of day.

12:47.280 --> 12:50.530
That baby there was abandoned for
its lack of potential,

12:50.530 --> 12:52.920
but none of that matters to me.

12:52.920 --> 12:57.760
Every child that enters this world should
have the chance to savor life.

12:58.370 --> 13:00.180
That's all there is to it.

13:01.250 --> 13:05.640
Wh-What a tragic tale!

13:05.640 --> 13:09.260
Taking a human child as your master,
suddenly bursting into tears...

13:09.920 --> 13:11.480
You're one bizarre demon.

13:13.460 --> 13:14.940
How about we make a deal?

13:15.270 --> 13:17.970
If you insist on taking him as your master,

13:17.970 --> 13:20.450
I can take you in as a personal attendant.

13:20.910 --> 13:21.740
How's that sound?

13:23.660 --> 13:26.770
I'll do as you say,
considering your circumstances.

13:26.770 --> 13:29.020
I'll watch over him by his side.

13:29.020 --> 13:31.990
Very well. It's a deal.

13:38.000 --> 13:41.570
Tear up that garb of his,
and swaddle him in this instead.

13:43.390 --> 13:45.880
Oh? A bit of subterfuge?

13:46.360 --> 13:47.230
Let us be off.

13:49.470 --> 13:52.180
Flay, can you get me that breast milk?

13:52.180 --> 13:54.600
The only breast milk you'll
be drinking is mine!

13:55.550 --> 13:56.530
<i>You're kidding, right?</i>

14:01.610 --> 14:03.030
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

14:04.120 --> 14:06.480
Father. Mother. Char.

14:06.480 --> 14:08.260
Good morning, everyone.

14:08.260 --> 14:09.870
Good morning, Haruto.

14:10.400 --> 14:11.840
<i>Nine years have passed.</i>

14:11.840 --> 14:15.680
<i>Under the care of Margrave Gold,
I managed to live on.</i>

14:16.530 --> 14:20.020
<i>My original plan was to leave as
soon as I'd been weaned off milk,</i>

14:20.020 --> 14:24.180
<i>but I was met with such kindness and comfort
that I just couldn't help but stay.</i>

14:23.510 --> 14:26.170
Say good morning to your brother.

14:24.940 --> 14:26.850
<i>If I have one problem in my life...</i>

14:30.820 --> 14:33.040
<i>Being hated by a cute little girl!</i>

14:33.040 --> 14:35.220
<i>You're making your brother so sad!</i>

14:35.480 --> 14:38.330
The two of you are as sullen as ever, I see.

14:38.330 --> 14:40.930
Can't you do any better
to cheer up Lord Haruto?!

14:40.930 --> 14:41.690
Here.

14:41.690 --> 14:43.900
The head chef put everything
he had into making this.

14:43.900 --> 14:44.500
Eat up.

14:46.530 --> 14:47.600
Here, young lady.

14:47.600 --> 14:48.830
Make sure you finish it all.

14:49.180 --> 14:51.290
Flay! Good morning!

14:53.780 --> 14:57.450
<b>Looks like you're doing
just fine, young lady!</b>

14:54.420 --> 14:56.770
<i>She's super fond of Flay...</i>

14:56.770 --> 14:57.440
<i>Why her?!</i>

14:57.750 --> 14:58.860
Hey, hey.

14:58.860 --> 15:00.410
Will you play with me again today?

15:00.660 --> 15:01.780
No can do.

15:01.780 --> 15:04.800
I've been entrusted with the important
task of looking after Lord Haruto.

15:04.800 --> 15:06.960
Flay. Please play with her.

15:07.820 --> 15:09.390
If I must.

15:09.390 --> 15:10.630
Hooray!

15:13.860 --> 15:15.990
Hey, wait for me!

15:16.600 --> 15:18.550
You're too slow, young lady!

15:20.040 --> 15:22.530
Haruto, don't let it bother you.

15:22.800 --> 15:23.660
Mom.

15:24.150 --> 15:25.920
It really doesn't bother me.

15:27.250 --> 15:29.030
Doesn't look that way to me.

15:29.480 --> 15:33.420
I think the reason Charlotte
is shy around you

15:33.420 --> 15:37.870
is because she doesn't know how
to act around a boy her age.

15:37.870 --> 15:38.990
You think?

15:38.990 --> 15:41.200
I'm sure of it!

15:41.200 --> 15:45.200
I mean, look at how well she gets
along with a girl like Flay!

15:45.960 --> 15:46.920
<i>Could it be?!</i>

15:46.920 --> 15:51.980
<i>Has Char figured out that I'm really
an old man who's almost thirty?!</i>

15:52.330 --> 15:55.130
You smell like a reclusive old man.

15:55.830 --> 15:57.530
<i>That makes sense.</i>

15:57.530 --> 16:00.060
<i>Little girls don't want
to hang out with old men.</i>

16:00.060 --> 16:02.600
Come now, no need for dramatics.

16:02.880 --> 16:04.330
I have an idea!

16:04.920 --> 16:07.950
Why not do something special for Char?

16:07.950 --> 16:10.240
If you show Char what a
reliable brother you are,

16:10.240 --> 16:12.880
I'm sure she'll have a change of heart!

16:12.880 --> 16:13.800
<i>Huh?</i>

16:13.800 --> 16:15.360
<i>I suck at social situations.</i>

16:15.360 --> 16:17.660
<i>That's asking for way too much out of me.</i>

16:17.660 --> 16:21.470
And you know, you're the heir
to this fine estate of ours.

16:21.470 --> 16:23.300
Instead of holing up in
your room all the time,

16:23.300 --> 16:25.300
why don't you join her outside
every once in a while?

16:26.510 --> 16:31.180
As your mother, I'll do everything
I can to help you two get along!

16:31.180 --> 16:33.750
Yeah... Thanks.

16:36.960 --> 16:39.580
I really should leave the nest soon.

16:39.580 --> 16:42.440
But if I leave, then Flay would come along.

16:42.440 --> 16:45.150
I'm sure that'll only end up
making Char hate me more.

16:45.480 --> 16:47.900
That said, if I tried
to leave Flay behind...

16:48.420 --> 16:51.080
If I can't be by my master's side,

16:51.080 --> 16:53.440
I have nothing more to live for!

16:53.920 --> 16:55.390
She'd totally say that.

16:56.230 --> 16:59.600
If I stay here, though, I bet they'll
make me do this and that...

17:00.710 --> 17:02.670
What's your take on this?

17:03.660 --> 17:06.920
<i>These past nine years, to prepare
for when I'd have to leave,</i>

17:06.920 --> 17:12.290
<i>I've studied as much about barrier magic
as I could, to create this robot copy...</i>

17:17.130 --> 17:20.540
But I still can't get it to talk or move.

17:21.890 --> 17:23.190
Hold on.

17:23.190 --> 17:26.000
If I want to leave without
making anyone sad...

17:27.290 --> 17:30.100
I need to make a Flay
doll as well, don't I?!

17:32.250 --> 17:33.380
Who is it?

17:33.380 --> 17:35.330
Haruto, come with me for a moment.

17:36.000 --> 17:37.840
<i>That can't be good!</i>

17:39.150 --> 17:41.950
Starting today, I'll be teaching
you how to use a sword.

17:42.290 --> 17:43.860
<i>See? I knew it!</i>

17:43.860 --> 17:46.290
Don't look so grumpy about it.

17:46.650 --> 17:49.280
You have an exceedingly low mana level.

17:49.280 --> 17:52.610
Which is why we need to have
you develop other skills.

17:53.050 --> 17:56.120
Or have you found some other
field that interests you?

17:56.340 --> 17:58.670
Well, that'd have to be shutting mysel—

17:59.280 --> 18:00.260
Um...

18:00.660 --> 18:02.210
Studying ancient magic?

18:03.380 --> 18:05.020
Well, I'll be.

18:05.020 --> 18:08.780
So you see potential in the lost
magic of the mythical era?

18:09.340 --> 18:12.240
I thought you were holed up
in your room doing nothing,

18:12.240 --> 18:13.780
but you were giving it
thought in your own way.

18:14.130 --> 18:16.630
Well, I should get back to my research...

18:16.630 --> 18:17.560
Not so fast.

18:17.840 --> 18:20.540
You might yet have talent with a sword.

18:20.540 --> 18:22.030
You never know unless you try.

18:23.000 --> 18:25.080
<i>Guess I can't weasel my way out of it...</i>

18:26.020 --> 18:27.920
Come! I'm ready when you are!

18:28.590 --> 18:32.750
<i>Dad is a seasoned warrior,
known as the Earth-Shattering Warhammer.</i>

18:32.750 --> 18:35.130
<i>There's no way I can land a hit on him!</i>

18:35.610 --> 18:37.650
<i>I really don't want to get hurt,</i>

18:37.650 --> 18:41.040
<i>so I'll use a barrier to make up
for my poor physical ability.</i>

18:43.330 --> 18:44.640
Hah!

18:44.640 --> 18:45.360
<i>Whoa!</i>

18:47.210 --> 18:49.330
<i>I forgot to put a barrier
up around the sword!</i>

18:50.600 --> 18:53.230
What was that just now?

18:53.690 --> 18:54.620
Huh?

18:54.620 --> 18:56.410
I'll stop in the nick of time...

18:56.410 --> 18:58.570
but try and dodge it anyway.

19:08.430 --> 19:09.970
<i>That was close!</i>

19:09.970 --> 19:12.980
<i>Stop in the nick of time?
That was a full-on swing!</i>

19:14.940 --> 19:19.000
That should have been impossible to
dodge for anyone under level 30.

19:20.320 --> 19:21.960
Are you sure?

19:22.570 --> 19:27.310
<i>To tell the truth, I also felt
something was off about that.</i>

19:28.240 --> 19:30.400
<i>There was a time when I got my hopes up,</i>

19:28.350 --> 19:32.310
<b>A Mija's Crystal</b>

19:28.350 --> 19:32.310
<b>that I made myself
with barrier magic</b>

19:30.400 --> 19:33.490
<i>and thought my mana level
might be in the hundreds...</i>

19:35.850 --> 19:39.800
<i>They say that level 77 was the
highest in all of humanity,</i>

19:39.800 --> 19:41.990
<i>so there's no way it'd
be in the thousands...</i>

19:42.320 --> 19:44.450
<i>I have a mana level of 2.</i>

19:44.450 --> 19:46.950
<i>And I've confirmed that
I possess no element.</i>

19:46.950 --> 19:52.820
<i>I concluded that my lack of an element
lets me use magic extremely efficiently.</i>

19:52.820 --> 19:56.260
<i>Is that a part of the overpowered
skills that the Goddess gave me?</i>

19:58.250 --> 20:00.500
An innate awakening?

20:00.500 --> 20:01.800
Which means...

20:02.370 --> 20:03.630
Never mind that.

20:03.630 --> 20:06.550
You move like a complete amateur.

20:06.550 --> 20:10.410
Now then, let's continue training,
and turn you into an elite swordsman.

20:10.740 --> 20:12.220
What?!

20:20.840 --> 20:23.600
You sure seem busy lately.

20:23.600 --> 20:28.210
I started teaching Haruto
how to use a sword today.

20:28.510 --> 20:30.560
Oh, how did it go?

20:31.040 --> 20:32.320
He might be...

20:33.730 --> 20:35.620
a returned demon.

20:36.600 --> 20:39.040
H-How could you say that, dear?!

20:39.040 --> 20:39.930
Shh.

20:40.550 --> 20:45.770
Secret royal family records tell
of a man who had lain with demons.

20:46.180 --> 20:50.390
Rare as it may be, there are those
born exhibiting demonic traits.

20:50.780 --> 20:54.320
That may be, but Haruto doesn't
have horns or a tail!

20:54.320 --> 20:55.600
That's true.

20:56.040 --> 21:01.810
However, it's said the royal insignia holds
strange powers we still don't understand.

21:01.810 --> 21:07.200
The secret to why the demon Flay shows such
deference to Haruto may lie there, as well.

21:07.820 --> 21:09.790
Haruto is a normal boy!

21:09.790 --> 21:11.990
Nothing more than that!

21:14.000 --> 21:15.420
Don't you worry.

21:15.420 --> 21:17.000
That's what I think, too.

21:17.420 --> 21:22.140
So no matter what happens,
we'll make sure our son lives a happy life.

21:22.650 --> 21:25.500
Yes, you're right.

21:28.930 --> 21:32.400
<i>There's no way Haruto is a demon.</i>

21:33.820 --> 21:37.990
<i>But... Haruto...</i>

23:09.030 --> 23:24.040
m 0 0 l 110 0 l 102.5 22 l 0 22

23:09.030 --> 23:24.040
Episode Preview

23:09.880 --> 23:11.650
My name is Charlotte!

23:11.650 --> 23:13.800
Flay is always nice and plays with me,

23:13.800 --> 23:17.080
but I don't know how to act around Haruto.

23:17.080 --> 23:18.830
Will we ever get along?

23:18.830 --> 23:20.920
Next episode: "Char Hates Me".

23:18.960 --> 23:24.040
<b>Char Hates Me</b>

23:20.920 --> 23:23.090
I don't hate you...
